{"title":"2002 USA TST","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 2002 USA <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TST\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TST\">TST</a> was given at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MOP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MOP\">MOP</a>, in Lincoln, Nebraska, on June 21 and 22.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems\">2002 USA TST Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 4\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2002 USA TST Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</sp